## The Front Step

@narrator{code="0010"}: Number nine Hollin Street smells of lemon polish and scones.
@aunt_mabel{code="0010"}: Pippa, darling! You're late, and the spoons are counted.
@pippa{code="0010" mono}: The spoons are always counted in this house.
